# Workshop Studio
workshop/public/
# workshop/static/images/ is NO LONGER ignored: Workshop Studio publishes these
# files directly and cannot render .svg, so package-assets.sh rasterizes the
# dark-theme diagrams (assets/*.svg) to committed PNGs here at build time.
# Generated by package-assets.sh: full infrastructure/ tree synced for the CFN-wrapper
# CodeBuild source. Single source of truth is infrastructure/; this copy is regenerated
# and S3-synced to the WS assets bucket at publish time (never committed).
workshop/assets/terraform/

